abstract: >-
  A practical, evidence-driven Quality Engineering framework for testing autonomous
  and agentic AI systems across task completion, tool use, trajectory correctness,
  grounding, approval boundaries, safety, recovery, memory isolation, efficiency,
  performance, observability, and regression quality. The framework advocates
  deterministic-first evaluation with model-based judges reserved for genuinely
  semantic dimensions.